  data: {
    LLM: '1. Draw a card from the deck or discard pile.\n2. Meld cards if possible (first meld must be worth 30+ points).\n3. **Joker Exchange**: If a Joker is on the table representing a 7 of Hearts, and you have the 7 of Hearts, you can swap them and keep the Joker for yourself.\n4. Discard one card to end turn.',
    Player: '1. Draw a card from the deck or discard pile.\n2. Meld cards if possible (first meld must be worth 30+ points).\n3. **Joker Exchange**: If a Joker is on the table representing a 7 of Hearts, and you have the 7 of Hearts, you can swap them and keep the Joker for yourself.\n4. Discard one card to end turn.',
    objective: 'Be the first to discard all cards by forming valid melds (sets and sequences) on the table.',
    gameplay: '1. Draw a card from the deck or discard pile.\n2. Meld cards if possible (first meld must be worth 30+ points).\n3. **Joker Exchange**: If a Joker is on the table representing a 7 of Hearts, and you have the 7 of Hearts, you can swap them and keep the Joker for yourself.\n4. Discard one card to end turn.',
